  Check: omega^5 = omega^(-1) = omega_bar = -0.500000-0.866025j
  D(omega^5) = D(omega_bar) = -D(omega) = -0.6766265875
  D(omega^2) = -D(omega) = -0.6766265875
  So omega^5 and omega^2 give the SAME Bloch-Wigner value. Consistent.

